# Types of tasks

A task is an instance of RL problem.

## Episodic task

- There is a start and end point
- Creates an episode: 
    - State
    - Action
    - Reward
    - New state

## Continuing tasks

- No terminal state
- Agent learn the process of choosing the best actions while interacting with the enviornment
- The agent keeps running until the user decides to stop it
